<h2>Cooley Gallery, Leesburg, VA</h2>
<p>I have two paintings currently for sale. See my <a title="Link to my gallery and online store" href="https://shop.portraitsbysimonbland.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">website</a>&nbsp;for prices and details of the paintings.</p>
<h2>Waterford Homes Tour and Craft Exhibit</h2>
<p>I have ten paintings hanging in the Red Barn on October 3, 4 and 5. Some parts of the exhibit were rearranged this year and consequently all my paintings can be found on the ground floor of the barn. See my <a title="Link to my gallery and online store" href="https://shop.portraitsbysimonbland.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">website</a>&nbsp;for prices and details of the paintings.</p>
<p>Any paintings which remain unsold after this event will then go to:</p>
<h2>Loudoun Sketch Club&nbsp;<span style="line-height: 1.42857143;">Aldie Mill Show</span></h2>
<p><span style="line-height: 1.42857143;">Which will run October 10 through 20. The work will be on the second floor of the mill. &nbsp;Check my blog for updates on which paintings I will have there.</span></p>